		set {mute::%{_v}%::msg} to "%nl%{@p} &7You were &4&lMUTED%nl%{@p} &7Reason: %{mute::%{_v}%::reason}%%nl%{@p} &7Duration: %{mute::%{_v}%::duration}%%nl%{@p} &7Ends: %{mute::%{_v}%::enddate}%%nl%{@p} &7Remaining: %{mute::%{_v}%::left}%%nl%"
		{_v} is online:
